  "description": "Free HTML to PDF converter for .NET on Linux ARM64 and Docker. This package contains no code: it installs the SelectPdf Community Edition (SelectPdf.HtmlToPdf.Universal) together with the Chromium engine package for linux-arm64. The engine is bundled, so Docker images need no apt-get. Requires glibc 2.30 or later. For Linux x64, use SelectPdf.HtmlToPdf.Linux. Free for personal and commercial use, up to 5 pages per document; the licensed SelectPdf.Universal package has no page limit.",
